    "de": [
      "Claudine und Jean-Philippe werden Sie in einem gemütlichen Rahmen empfangen und Ihnen ihre Küche vorstellen."
    ],
    "en": [
      "Traditional restaurant with a market-based menu. All our dishes are prepared fresh and with products from local producers. Closed Wednesdays. Sunday and Monday evenings with reservation for 15+ only."
